{"id":"torrey:faithfulness-of-god-the","source":"torrey","name":"Faithfulness Of God, The","slug":"faithfulness-of-god-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Is part of his character — Isa 49:7; 1Co 1:9; 1Th 5:24.","refs":[["Isa",49,7,49,7],["1Cor",1,9,1,9],["1Thess",5,24,5,24]]},{"text":"Great. — La 3:23.","refs":[["Lam",3,23,3,23]]},{"text":"Established. — Ps 89:2.","refs":[["Ps",89,2,89,2]]},{"text":"Incomparable. — Ps 89:8.","refs":[["Ps",89,8,89,8]]},{"text":"Unfailing. — Ps 89:33; 2Ti 2:13.","refs":[["Ps",89,33,89,33],["2Tim",2,13,2,13]]},{"text":"Infinite. — Ps 36:5.","refs":[["Ps",36,5,36,5]]},{"text":"Everlasting. — Ps 119:90; 146:6.","refs":[["Ps",119,90,119,90],["Ps",146,6,146,6]]},{"text":"Should be pleaded in prayer — Ps 143:1.","refs":[["Ps",143,1,143,1]]},{"text":"Should be proclaimed — Ps 40:10; 89:1.","refs":[["Ps",40,10,40,10],["Ps",89,1,89,1]]},{"text":"In his counsels. — Isa 25:1.","refs":[["Isa",25,1,25,1]]},{"text":"In afflicting his saints. — Ps 119:75.","refs":[["Ps",119,75,119,75]]},{"text":"In fulfilling his promises. — 1Ki 8:20; Ps 132:11; Mic 7:20; Heb 10:23.","refs":[["1Kgs",8,20,8,20],["Ps",132,11,132,11],["Mic",7,20,7,20],["Heb",10,23,10,23]]},{"text":"In keeping his covenant. — De 7:9; Ps 111:5.","refs":[["Deut",7,9,7,9],["Ps",111,5,111,5]]},{"text":"In executing his judgments. — Jer 23:20; 51:29.","refs":[["Jer",23,20,23,20],["Jer",51,29,51,29]]},{"text":"In forgiving sins. — 1Jo 1:9.","refs":[["1John",1,9,1,9]]},{"text":"To his saints. — Ps 89:24; 2Th 3:3.","refs":[["Ps",89,24,89,24],["2Thess",3,3,3,3]]},{"text":"Saints encouraged to depend on. — 1Pe 4:19.","refs":[["1Pet",4,19,4,19]]},{"text":"Should be magnified. — Ps 89:5; 92:2.","refs":[["Ps",89,5,89,5],["Ps",92,2,92,2]]}],"refCount":30}
